1
00:00:20,800 --> 00:00:22,700
(Silence; Operating Room Area)

2
00:00:39,680 --> 00:00:43,560
=Stand Up for Love=

3
00:00:43,720 --> 00:00:46,680
=Episode 9=

4
00:00:59,320 --> 00:01:00,119
Lulu.

5
00:01:03,320 --> 00:01:04,159
Mom.

6
00:01:07,319 --> 00:01:08,040
Mom.

7
00:01:08,560 --> 00:01:09,640
Haotian and I are already married.

8
00:01:09,640 --> 00:01:11,359
Why do you still refuse to accept him?

9
00:01:11,799 --> 00:01:12,959
Signing a prenuptial agreement,

10
00:01:12,959 --> 00:01:14,560
do you know how hurtful it is?

11
00:01:14,879 --> 00:01:17,040
He always feels like he doesn't
belong in this family.

12
00:01:17,040 --> 00:01:18,319
Like he'll never have your approval.

13
00:01:18,319 --> 00:01:19,560
It's affecting our relationship.

14
00:01:19,560 --> 00:01:20,920
Don't you understand?

15
00:01:21,319 --> 00:01:22,000
Lulu.

16
00:01:22,319 --> 00:01:24,319
If you want to keep Zhang Haotian
by your side,

17
00:01:24,319 --> 00:01:26,760
this agreement must stay with me.

18
00:01:28,319 --> 00:01:29,560
Trust me.

19
00:01:29,680 --> 00:01:31,280
I would never hurt you.

20
00:01:32,040 --> 00:01:33,319
Give me the password.

21
00:01:33,319 --> 00:01:34,000
No.

22
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:35,120
Tell me!

23
00:01:35,120 --> 00:01:36,760
I won't say it twice.

24
00:01:42,239 --> 00:01:44,159
(Haotian is starting to get restless.)

25
00:01:44,319 --> 00:01:45,840
(I need to put him in his place.)

26
00:01:46,560 --> 00:01:48,319
(That woman named Zhao Ke...)

27
00:01:48,319 --> 00:01:50,079
(Maybe she can be useful.)

28
00:01:53,879 --> 00:01:54,680
Ms. Su.

29
00:01:55,519 --> 00:01:56,519
Zhao Ke's file.

30
00:02:02,000 --> 00:02:03,800
(Background Check: Zhao Ke)

31
00:02:04,560 --> 00:02:05,519
Ms. Su.

32
00:02:06,640 --> 00:02:07,480
Ms. Su?

33
00:02:07,920 --> 00:02:09,560
(Background Check: Zhao Ke)

34
00:02:09,560 --> 00:02:11,240
How strange.

35
00:02:11,840 --> 00:02:12,919
When I look at her,

36
00:02:13,919 --> 00:02:16,159
I feel something I can't quite explain.

37
00:02:20,240 --> 00:02:21,960
(Unknown Number)

38
00:02:24,919 --> 00:02:26,199
What brings you here?

39
00:02:26,680 --> 00:02:28,919
Are you sure you want to keep
going with this?

40
00:02:31,400 --> 00:02:33,319
Zhang Haotian believes I'm Zhao Ke.

41
00:02:33,400 --> 00:02:35,000
My nightclub persona played
a huge part in that.

42
00:02:35,080 --> 00:02:36,479
If I suddenly quit now,

43
00:02:36,479 --> 00:02:38,199
he'll get suspicious.

44
00:02:38,240 --> 00:02:40,599
I've set a trap specifically
for Zhang Haotian.

45
00:02:40,680 --> 00:02:42,520
Once he falls in, he won't be able
to escape.

46
00:02:43,719 --> 00:02:46,199
So don't force yourself

47
00:02:46,560 --> 00:02:47,680
to do something you don't want to do.

48
00:02:48,080 --> 00:02:49,039
But

49
00:02:49,639 --> 00:02:51,199
I don't want to just wait here.

50
00:02:51,479 --> 00:02:53,599
My other kidney is with Su Qinglan.

51
00:02:53,680 --> 00:02:56,400
I want to find a way to get close
to her.

52
00:02:56,479 --> 00:02:57,039
And...

53
00:02:57,039 --> 00:02:59,240
Su Qinglan is a successful
businesswoman.

54
00:02:59,280 --> 00:03:01,360
She must know Zhang Haotian's
true nature.

55
00:03:01,479 --> 00:03:04,000
If she knew the truth and still
let her daughter marry him,

56
00:03:04,240 --> 00:03:06,280
she'd never side with an outsider.

57
00:03:07,080 --> 00:03:08,080
If things go wrong,

58
00:03:08,080 --> 00:03:09,400
the moment you contact her,

59
00:03:09,599 --> 00:03:11,000
Zhang Haotian will find out.

60
00:03:11,479 --> 00:03:13,400
Then we'll really be in trouble.

61
00:03:16,360 --> 00:03:18,560
(Unknown Number)
Hold on, I need to take this call.

62
00:03:19,560 --> 00:03:20,159
Hello?

63
00:03:20,159 --> 00:03:21,000
Hi.

64
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:23,000
This is Su Qinglan.

65
00:03:25,800 --> 00:03:26,919
Ms. Su?

66
00:03:27,240 --> 00:03:28,639
What can I do for you?

67
00:03:29,439 --> 00:03:30,960
When are you available?

68
00:03:31,080 --> 00:03:32,240
I'd like to meet and talk.

69
00:03:33,479 --> 00:03:34,479
I work nights.

70
00:03:34,479 --> 00:03:35,599
I'm free during the day.

71
00:03:35,639 --> 00:03:39,400
Alright. I'll let you know the time
and place.

72
00:03:41,360 --> 00:03:42,400
It was Su Qinglan.

73
00:03:42,439 --> 00:03:43,680
She suddenly asked to meet with me.

74
00:03:45,120 --> 00:03:46,599
It's her?

75
00:03:52,680 --> 00:03:54,599
(Lin Lulu definitely didn't
get the agreement.)

76
00:03:55,280 --> 00:03:56,599
(Otherwise, given her personality,)

77
00:03:57,080 --> 00:03:58,680
(she would've called me by now.)

78
00:04:02,319 --> 00:04:03,120
Baby.

79
00:04:04,599 --> 00:04:06,039
Why are you crying, baby?

80
00:04:06,960 --> 00:04:07,960
I'm sorry.

81
00:04:08,759 --> 00:04:10,680
I couldn't get the agreement back.

82
00:04:12,400 --> 00:04:13,319
I'm sorry.

83
00:04:13,800 --> 00:04:15,120
It's okay.

84
00:04:16,360 --> 00:04:17,879
Whether you got the agreement or not,

85
00:04:17,879 --> 00:04:19,199
I'm still your husband.

86
00:04:19,800 --> 00:04:23,079
I'll always be the man who loves you
most in this life.

87
00:04:31,399 --> 00:04:33,000
(If I can't get the agreement back,)

88
00:04:33,160 --> 00:04:36,560
(then I'll have to get rid
of Su Qinglan sooner than planned.)

89
00:04:41,600 --> 00:04:42,360
Baby,

90
00:04:43,759 --> 00:04:45,079
I'm a little tired today.

91
00:04:46,160 --> 00:04:47,360
I'll get some rest first, okay?

92
00:05:10,240 --> 00:05:11,199
Honey?

93
00:05:18,360 --> 00:05:20,760
(All-Star Party Space)

94
00:05:23,160 --> 00:05:23,959
Zhao Ke.

95
00:05:24,639 --> 00:05:26,920
I'm giving you a chance
to earn my forgiveness.

96
00:05:26,920 --> 00:05:27,480
No.

97
00:05:27,720 --> 00:05:28,959
I don't need your forgiveness.

98
00:05:29,040 --> 00:05:30,639
Name your price.

99
00:05:30,639 --> 00:05:31,759
No amount of money will make me do it.

100
00:05:32,399 --> 00:05:33,120
Zhao Ke.

101
00:05:33,759 --> 00:05:35,439
I've already lowered myself
by coming to you.

102
00:05:35,720 --> 00:05:37,000
And you still don't know
what's good for you?

103
00:05:37,360 --> 00:05:39,439
Don't make me have someone
drag you there.

104
00:05:42,199 --> 00:05:44,079
You don't seem to understand.

105
00:05:44,519 --> 00:05:46,920
Did you really think the videos
of Zhang Haotian and me

106
00:05:46,920 --> 00:05:48,399
only showed what happened at the mall?

107
00:05:48,600 --> 00:05:49,519
No.

108
00:05:49,600 --> 00:05:50,600
There's footage in the car.

109
00:05:50,639 --> 00:05:52,319
And there's footage here too.

110
00:05:52,319 --> 00:05:54,439
I think you're just trying to drive
a wedge between me and my husband.

111
00:05:54,439 --> 00:05:55,759
Shut up!

112
00:05:58,639 --> 00:05:59,959
If you have that much free time,

113
00:05:59,959 --> 00:06:01,839
come on, let's go upstairs
and check the cameras.

114
00:06:02,040 --> 00:06:04,399
Let's see what your precious husband

115
00:06:04,399 --> 00:06:05,639
is really like.

116
00:06:06,800 --> 00:06:09,439
Zhao Ke, I'll make you pay

117
00:06:09,439 --> 00:06:10,959
for these lies!

118
00:06:11,360 --> 00:06:12,600
I won't let you off.

119
00:06:21,120 --> 00:06:23,279
Are you sure you want to increase
the dosage for Su Qinglan?

120
00:06:25,199 --> 00:06:26,319
I've had enough of Lin Lulu.

121
00:06:27,000 --> 00:06:28,800
I can't wait any longer. Besides...

122
00:06:32,600 --> 00:06:34,519
Su Qinglan must be investigating me
behind my back.

123
00:06:34,600 --> 00:06:35,480
She can't be left alive.

124
00:06:36,600 --> 00:06:38,160
I understand. It's just that...

125
00:06:38,160 --> 00:06:39,639
You're more experienced
in this area than I am.

126
00:06:39,800 --> 00:06:40,800
Yet you're still worried?

127
00:06:41,519 --> 00:06:42,920
I can't explain it.

128
00:06:43,279 --> 00:06:44,920
I just have a bad feeling about this.

129
00:06:45,959 --> 00:06:47,519
Just sit back and wait.

130
00:06:48,560 --> 00:06:50,000
You'll enjoy
your wealth and luxury soon.

131
00:06:57,759 --> 00:06:58,600
Haotian.

132
00:07:00,800 --> 00:07:01,800
Haotian.

133
00:07:03,319 --> 00:07:04,360
Haotian.

134
00:07:06,800 --> 00:07:07,600
Lulu.

135
00:07:08,600 --> 00:07:09,959
You were gone first thing this morning.

136
00:07:10,000 --> 00:07:11,120
Where did you go?

137
00:07:11,759 --> 00:07:12,920
Were you with another woman?

138
00:07:13,480 --> 00:07:14,360
Answer me!

139
00:07:14,360 --> 00:07:16,160
Zhang Haotian. Answer me!

140
00:07:17,079 --> 00:07:18,800
I went to the office to handle
some things.

141
00:07:19,079 --> 00:07:20,160
There is no other woman.

142
00:07:20,800 --> 00:07:21,800
I don't believe you.

143
00:07:22,079 --> 00:07:23,079
Give me your phone.

144
00:07:23,600 --> 00:07:24,879
Let me check your phone.

145
00:07:25,399 --> 00:07:26,360
What's wrong, Lulu?

146
00:07:27,120 --> 00:07:28,160
Zhang Haotian,

147
00:07:29,399 --> 00:07:30,319
who is this?

148
00:07:31,000 --> 00:07:32,600
Who's your "best love"?

149
00:07:33,240 --> 00:07:35,079
I knew it. You have someone else.

150
00:07:39,319 --> 00:07:41,399
(My Best Love)
Who is it? Who?

151
00:07:41,400 --> 00:07:42,440
(Pinned; Be With U
This Year, Next Year, Every Year)

152
00:07:43,680 --> 00:07:44,480
Me?

153
00:07:45,480 --> 00:07:45,959
I...

154
00:07:48,000 --> 00:07:49,079
My contact name...

155
00:07:49,680 --> 00:07:51,319
When did you change it?

156
00:07:53,079 --> 00:07:54,879
After you found out about Zhao Ke
and me.

157
00:07:56,199 --> 00:07:58,279
Lulu, lately,

158
00:07:58,519 --> 00:08:00,959
a lot of things have happened
that hurt you.

159
00:08:01,959 --> 00:08:03,319
Let me take you somewhere to relax.

160
00:08:06,759 --> 00:08:08,319
(Taking you away to clear your mind)

161
00:08:08,720 --> 00:08:11,040
(is just to buy me enough time
to make my move)

162
00:08:11,639 --> 00:08:14,399
(and create an alibi.)

163
00:08:30,080 --> 00:08:31,320
(Su Qinglan Calling)

164
00:08:34,759 --> 00:08:35,720
Hello, Ms. Su.

165
00:08:36,320 --> 00:08:38,600
Miss Zhao, I'm terribly sorry.

166
00:08:38,759 --> 00:08:40,080
I'd like to change the time.

167
00:08:41,200 --> 00:08:43,240
Of course. I'll work around
your schedule.

168
00:08:49,880 --> 00:08:51,760
(Su Qinglan
Call in Progress)

169
00:08:52,159 --> 00:08:53,000
Ms. Su?

170
00:08:54,600 --> 00:08:55,440
Ms. Su?

171
00:08:56,399 --> 00:08:57,240
Ms. Su?

172
00:08:58,720 --> 00:08:59,600
(Su Qinglan
Call Ended)

173
00:09:04,039 --> 00:09:04,759
Ms. Su?

174
00:09:05,159 --> 00:09:06,039
Ms. Su?

175
00:09:16,080 --> 00:09:16,639
Hello?

176
00:09:17,600 --> 00:09:18,440
911?

177
00:09:19,000 --> 00:09:21,040
(Crocodile Tears)

178
00:09:21,960 --> 00:09:25,840
♪Listen, the wind chimes softly whisper♪

179
00:09:25,920 --> 00:09:28,720
♪I should forget you♪

180
00:09:29,560 --> 00:09:33,960
♪But I have the will,
yet not the strength♪

181
00:09:34,400 --> 00:09:35,920
♪To carry on♪

182
00:09:36,800 --> 00:09:41,160
♪The scenery you once longed to see♪

183
00:09:41,920 --> 00:09:44,840
♪You no longer have the strength♪

184
00:09:46,280 --> 00:09:49,640
♪You want me to go there for you♪

185
00:09:50,480 --> 00:09:55,800
♪I look up and see a hollow sky♪

186
00:09:56,120 --> 00:09:59,960
♪Your freedom♪

187
00:10:00,640 --> 00:10:05,440
♪Has become my cage♪

188
00:10:06,160 --> 00:10:12,240
♪My hand brushes over your smile
in the photograph♪

189
00:10:12,560 --> 00:10:18,360
♪This glass of wine is filled
with sorrow♪

190
00:10:19,680 --> 00:10:25,760
♪I look up at the beautiful night sky♪

191
00:10:25,800 --> 00:10:28,640
♪You told me♪

192
00:10:28,640 --> 00:10:33,800
♪I would shine like a star♪

193
00:10:34,880 --> 00:10:38,840
♪But you forgot to teach me♪

194
00:10:38,840 --> 00:10:42,480
♪How to live without you♪

195
00:10:42,720 --> 00:10:46,880
♪I look up♪

196
00:10:46,880 --> 00:10:49,640
♪The starry sky♪

197
00:10:49,960 --> 00:10:53,440
♪So hazy and blurred♪
